00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:48.920
The following solutions,
services, APIs, and models

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.500
all help with AI needs
at every single level

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.280
of expertise and readiness.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:53.780
You.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:56.840
Really don't need to be an
ML expert to get started.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:00.110
We have easy-to-use
APIs or AutoML models

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.990
that allow you to
create a customized

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:06.470
