00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:12.410
to create exactly what you need.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:16.160
Underneath this entire portfolio
are our hardware accelerators,

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:19.594
Cloud TPUs, Cloud GPUs,
and Compute Engine.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:25.750
There's three main ways to
take advantage of accelerators

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:27.520
on Google Cloud.

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:31.060
First we have Vertex AI,
offering end-to-end AI

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:34.920
and ML tooling and
scheduling via GKE

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.940
using containers, enabling
GPUs and TPUs as a service,

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:42.570
removing the burden from you to
manage the hardware or the VMs

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.100
for your AI workload.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.050
Simply give your
containers access

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:49.170
